is actually printed on that terminal.

171
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:44,440
Right?

172
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:48,940
This is a standard embedded cross-development environment.

173
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:49,980
Now, currently,

174
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:50,760
what we actually want to do is,

175
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,000
on this emulator,

